DESCRIPTION:Every atom in your body was forged in the belly of a dying sta
 r. The calcium in your bones\, the iron in your blood\, the carbon threadi
 ng through every strand of your DNA — all of it cooked at temperatures b
 eyond human language\, scattered across the void\, and reassembled over bi
 llions of years into something that walks into a bar on a Tuesday night an
 d listens.\n\nSanders\, Boyd\, Page & Hall are four collections of stellar
  debris who have chosen to spend their brief window of consciousness makin
 g original music together. Not playing songs. Not running repertoire. Buil
 ding something in real time from the raw material of attention\, instinct\
 , and decades of accumulated craft — compositions that didn't exist befo
 re these particular particles arranged themselves around instruments in th
 is part...
LOCATION:Little Jumbo: 241 Broadway St.\, Asheville\, NC 28801
URL:https://www.littlejumbobar.com/events/2273/sanders-boyd-page-hall
